 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg>",{"_72":357,"_79":89,"_74":242,"_83":358,"_92":-7,"_12":359,"_94":360},"es:platform/iot-fleets/overview.mdx","Organiza los dispositivos y sus identidades, prepara el enrolamiento e integra consumidores.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/iot-fleets/overview",{"_96":361},"platform/iot-fleets/overview.mdx",{"_79":80,"_74":363,"_81":-7,"_82":-7,"_83":-7,"_85":-7,"_76":364,"_72":446,"_94":447,"_92":449},"<span><span>Poscuántica (PQC)</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-[3px] bg-[var(--lm-badge-bg)] px-1.5 py-px text-[0.58rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white ml-2 align-middle\">Beta</span></span>",[365,371,376,379,384,389,392,397,402,407,410,415,420,423,428,433,438,441],{"_72":366,"_79":89,"_74":367,"_83":368,"_92":-7,"_12":63,"_94":369},"es:platform/pqc/welcome.mdx","Bienvenida","Un recorrido interactivo por el soporte poscuántico de Lamassu, del toolchain de Go al dispositivo, con los resultados de interoperabilidad.",{"_96":370},"platform/pqc/welcome.mdx",{"_72":372,"_79":89,"_74":55,"_83":373,"_92":-7,"_12":13,"_94":374},"es:platform/pqc/overview.mdx","Qué soporte poscuántico (PQC) añade Lamassu a las claves, las autoridades de certificación, el TLS de los dispositivos y el despliegue, y cómo encajan sus piezas.",{"_96":375},"platform/pqc/overview.mdx",{"_72":377,"_79":117,"_92":-7,"_74":378},"es:_7","Algoritmos y toolchain",{"_72":380,"_79":89,"_74":27,"_83":381,"_92":-7,"_12":25,"_94":382},"es:platform/pqc/algorithms.mdx","Los algoritmos de firma poscuánticos y composite que soporta Lamassu, cómo se identifica cada uno en las peticiones a la API y los estándares que siguen.",{"_96":383},"platform/pqc/algorithms.mdx",{"_72":385,"_79":89,"_74":38,"_83":386,"_92":-7,"_12":37,"_94":387},"es:platform/pqc/go-toolchain.mdx","El fork de Go que añade ML-DSA composite, SLH-DSA, certificados relacionados y esquemas de firma TLS composite, la API que expone y cómo se compila.",{"_96":388},"platform/pqc/go-toolchain.mdx",{"_72":390,"_79":117,"_92":-7,"_74":391},"es:_8","Soporte en la plataforma",{"_72":393,"_79":89,"_74":50,"_83":394,"_92":-7,"_12":49,"_94":395},"es:platform/pqc/keys-and-cas.mdx","Crear claves y CA poscuánticas, firmar con ellas y emitir certificados, con el soporte de motores, los valores de la API y las restricciones aplicables.",{"_96":396},"platform/pqc/keys-and-cas.mdx",{"_72":398,"_79":89,"_74":58,"_83":399,"_92":-7,"_12":57,"_94":400},"es:platform/pqc/related-certificates.mdx","Vincular un certificado con clave poscuántica a un certificado clásico existente del mismo dispositivo, según el RFC 9763, y cómo los emite y comprueba Lamassu.",{"_96":401},"platform/pqc/related-certificates.mdx",{"_72":403,"_79":89,"_74":32,"_83":404,"_92":-7,"_12":31,"_94":405},"es:platform/pqc/dashboard.mdx","Cómo expone la interfaz web los algoritmos poscuánticos al crear claves, CA y certificados, y cómo los muestra.",{"_96":406},"platform/pqc/dashboard.mdx",{"_72":408,"_79":117,"_92":-7,"_74":409},"es:_9","Despliegue",{"_72":411,"_79":89,"_74":61,"_83":412,"_92":-7,"_12":60,"_94":413},"es:platform/pqc/tls-front-proxy.mdx","El fork de Traefik que termina el TLS de los dispositivos con certificados clásicos y poscuánticos para el mismo host, cómo elige certificado y cómo se compila.",{"_96":414},"platform/pqc/tls-front-proxy.mdx",{"_72":416,"_79":89,"_74":35,"_83":417,"_92":-7,"_12":34,"_94":418},"es:platform/pqc/deployment.mdx","Desplegar Lamassu con un proxy frontal Traefik que sirve certificados clásicos, poscuánticos y composite, mediante los valores del chart o el instalador fast-lane.",{"_96":419},"platform/pqc/deployment.mdx",{"_72":421,"_79":117,"_92":-7,"_74":422},"es:_10","Pruebas de integración",{"_72":424,"_79":89,"_74":47,"_83":425,"_92":-7,"_12":46,"_94":426},"es:platform/pqc/integration-tests/overview.mdx","Evidencia de que software ajeno a Lamassu negocia intercambio de claves poscuántico y verifica los certificados poscuánticos y composite que sirve Lamassu.",{"_96":427},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/overview.mdx",{"_72":429,"_79":89,"_74":41,"_83":430,"_92":-7,"_12":40,"_94":431},"es:platform/pqc/integration-tests/https.mdx","Resultados de probar un endpoint HTTPS de Lamassu con OpenSSL y curl usando intercambio de claves poscuántico y certificados poscuánticos y composite.",{"_96":432},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/https.mdx",{"_72":434,"_79":89,"_74":44,"_83":435,"_92":-7,"_12":43,"_94":436},"es:platform/pqc/integration-tests/mqtts.mdx","Resultados de probar un broker MQTT detrás del proxy TLS de Lamassu con mosquitto, usando intercambio de claves poscuántico y certificados poscuánticos y composite.",{"_96":437},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/mqtts.mdx",{"_72":439,"_79":117,"_92":-7,"_74":440},"es:_11","Referencia",{"_72":442,"_79":89,"_74":53,"_83":443,"_92":-7,"_12":52,"_94":444},"es:platform/pqc/limitations.mdx","Qué está incompleto, es no estándar o no está verificado en el soporte poscuántico de Lamassu, agrupado por componente.",{"_96":445},"platform/pqc/limitations.mdx","es:platform/pqc",{"_231":448},"platform/pqc/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-atom shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\"